## Python Instruction
Write a python function to check if a number is a special number or not. A special number is a number that has no repeated digits.

## Python Solution
```python
def is_special_number(n: int) -> bool:
	def isSpecial(n: int): 
		strr = str(n) 
		mp = {}
		for j in strr: 
			if j in mp: 
				return False 
			mp[j] = 1
		return True
	return isSpecial(n)
```

## Python Tests
assert is_special_number(112233) == False
assert is_special_number(123456) == True
assert is_special_number(123) == True

